# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Credentials and real mail data.
#
# This block is first on purpose. It is what stands between a public
# repository and a leak. Before adding anything below, check that it does
# not weaken what is here.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# OAuth client id / secret
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Refresh token captured by the Phase 0 spikes (plaintext, mode 0600)
spikes/.secrets.json

# Spike output: unredacted API responses and the redaction mapping table
spikes/out/

# Local data directory: message bodies, attachments, encrypted credential file
.zmail/
.zmail-*/
**/mail.sqlite3
**/mail.sqlite3-wal
**/mail.sqlite3-shm
**/secrets.enc

# Exports contain real mail
*.mbox
*.eml
/export/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Internal design documents.
#
# Must be `docs/*`, not `docs/`. Excluding a directory outright makes any
# later negation inert, which would silently drop the setup guide the
# README links to.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
docs/*
!docs/oauth-setup.md

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Build output and dependencies
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
*.tgz
coverage/
.vitest/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Editors and operating systems
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp
*~

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Logs and scratch space
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
/tmp/
.tmp/
